Description: CCTV stream viewer with multi-surface support
 CCTV Viewer is a Qt 6 application for viewing multiple video
 streams simultaneously. Features include:
  - Multiple preset layouts with carousel switching
  - Multi-surface video distribution (shared decoders)
  - Custom aspect ratios
  - Kiosk mode with edit protection
  - systemd user service for 24/7 operation
